### Get all users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users


### Create user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Marko",
  "lastName": "Markovic",
  "email": "marko@example.com"
}

### Create another user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Jovanovic",
  "email": "ana@example.com"
}

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Petrovic",
  "email": "ana.petrovic@example.com"
}

### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/2

### Get deleted user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/2

### Create user using DTO
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Nikola",
  "lastName": "Nikolic",
  "email": "nikola@example.com"
}


### Korinsik ne moze sam da setuje id, dodeljuje se automatski
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "firstName": "Petar",
  "lastName": "Petrovic",
  "email": "petar@example.com"
}

### Create valid user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jovan",
  "lastName": "Jovanovic",
  "email": "jovan@example.com"
}

### Create invalid user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "J",
  "email": "banana"
}


### Get invalid user ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/999

### Same email address test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Milan",
  "lastName": "Milic",
  "email": "milan@example.com"
}

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Marko",
  "lastName": "Markovic",
  "email": "marko.novi@example.com"
}

### Update user with invalid data
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "M",
  "email": "banana"
}